Third-party components
----------------------

software/PCIE_FRA/ contains sources vendored from AMD's embeddedsw repository
(the standalone BSP, its drivers, and the Zynq FSBL). Those files carry their
own AMD copyright notices and are distributed under the MIT License; see the
per-file headers. They are included so the firmware can be built without a
Vitis workspace, and are not modified.

docs/board_files/ contains manufacturer documentation for the Alinx AX7015B
board and the AN108 AD/DA module, together with component datasheets. These are
redistributed reference material and remain the property of their respective
publishers; they are not covered by the licence above.
